  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NEFCO - Green Recovery Programme for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Fund is solely and exclusively to fund activities in support of sustainable rehabilitation and rebuilding the infrastructure destroyed or damaged as a result of the Russian war in Ukraine to ensure that Ukraine is built back better and greener in accordance with Annex 1 hereto. 

The expected outcomes of the Contribution are:
Enhanced capacity and capability of Ukrainian municipalities to plan and implement green recovery measures;
Short-term repair, maintenance, and upgrade of municipal infrastructure, including restoration of public service buildings and rebuilding of medium-sized utilities and facilities;
Improved access to basic municipal services for internally displaced people;
Restoration and upgrade of social infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
